          "type": "final",
          "verdict": "findings_remain",
          "findings": [
            {
              "message": "AC-06 contradicts IN-04 as written: a real `git stash` records stash commit objects and updates `refs/stash`, while a successful pop updates that ref again. Therefore stash/stash-pop cannot satisfy the blanket requirement to create no commit and update no ref. Clarify that branch history and branch refs must remain unchanged while permitting the stash-internal objects/ref required by D3.",
